              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nicka"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good alternative. I used more cinnamon and added vanilla as well, and also blended the simple syrup with soaked cashews that I had leftover from another recipe. Turned out pretty good.",
            "datePublished": "2015-10-14T12:26:54.170Z"
