              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Run4fun"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We LOVE this recipe for horchata! My kids ask for it often and now I've made it with kids at a couple different camps. It's easy for them to make, they love it, and it helps introduce them to a cultural food they often haven't tried before. The only modification I have made is to add a little more cinnamon (1 scant tsp instead of 1/4).",
